flowchart TD
    title Complete E-Commerce Workflow

    A[Customer Visits Site] --> B[Load Homepage]
    B --> C{Has Account?}
    C -->|No| D[Register / Login]
    C -->|Yes| E[Browse Catalog]

    D --> F{Registration Valid?}
    F -->|No| G[Show Errors]
    G --> D
    F -->|Yes| H[Create Account]
    H --> I[Send Welcome Email]
    I --> E

    E --> J[Search Products]
    J --> K[Apply Filters]
    K --> L[View Product Details]
    L --> M{Add to Cart?}
    M -->|No| E
    M -->|Yes| N[Add to Cart]
    N --> O[Update Cart Badge]
    O --> P{Continue Shopping?}
    P -->|Yes| E
    P -->|No| Q[View Cart]

    Q --> R[Review Items]
    R --> S[Apply Coupon]
    S --> T[Calculate Total]
    T --> U[Proceed to Checkout]

    U --> V[Select Address]
    V --> W{Address OK?}
    W -->|No| X[Add Address]
    X --> V
    W -->|Yes| Y[Select Payment]

    Y --> Z{Payment Method?}
    Z -->|Card| AA[Enter Card Details]
    Z -->|PayPal| AB[PayPal Flow]
    Z -->|Crypto| AC[Crypto Flow]

    AA --> AD[Validate Card]
    AD -->|Invalid| AE[Show Error]
    AE --> Y
    AD -->|Valid| AF[Reserve Stock]

    AF --> AG{Stock OK?}
    AG -->|No| AH[Show Out of Stock]
    AH --> Q
    AG -->|Yes| AI[Process Payment]

    AI --> AJ{Payment OK?}
    AJ -->|No| AK[Release Stock]
    AK --> AL[Show Payment Error]
    AL --> Y
    AJ -->|Yes| AM[Create Order]

    AM --> AN[Send Confirmation]
    AN --> AO[Generate Invoice]
    AO --> AP[Route to Fulfillment]

    AP --> AQ[Pick & Pack]
    AQ --> AR[Generate Shipping Label]
    AR --> AS[Hand to Carrier]
    AS --> AT[Send Tracking Email]

    AT --> AU[Customer Receives]
    AU --> AV{Satisfied?}
    AV -->|Yes| AW[Leave Review]
    AV -->|No| AX[Request Return]

    AX --> AY{Return Valid?}
    AY -->|No| AZ[Deny Return]
    AY -->|Yes| BA[Process Refund]
    BA --> BB[Restock Item]
    BB --> BC[Send Refund Email]
